5635-
5636:Identify Data word 53 bit 0 shall be set to 1 at all times that the drive is in a valid translation mode. Some
5637-drives may have translation modes that cannot be supported. An attempt to put a drive into one of these
5638-unsupported modes shall cause word 53 bit 0 to be set to 0 with words 54-58 cleared to zero until a valid
5639-translation mode is established.
