5642-
5643-Identify Data word 54 (Current Cylinders) shall specify the number of full logical cylinders that can be
5644-accessed in the current translation mode. If an Initialize Drive Parameters command has not been executed,
5645:the contents of this word shall be the same as word 1. If an Initialize Drive Parameters command has been
5646-executed, this word is the integer result of dividing the total number of user sectors (this value may be in
5647-words 60-61) by the number of sectors per logical cylinder ( [word55] x [word56] ), but shall not be a value
5648-greater than 65,535.

