codex
Every call to this initializer registers two bytes; the machine branches change only the base address. That supports narrowing within this file, but it does not establish the full list of callers or what each bus does afterward.

There’s also a key distinction for the DD7 row: a clear value bit does not prove an undriven signal. After narrowing, the test must verify that an access occurred and WDC supplied no response, even when valid status reports BSY.

