  1024: 4.5.1 ATA-2 driver types and required pull-ups
  1025: 
  1026:                          Table 4 - ATA-2 driver types and required pull-ups
  1027: 
  1028:    Signal                Source Driver Type Pull-up at   Pull-up at Notes
  1029: 
  1030:                                  (See note 1)   host     each device
  1031: 
  1032:                                                 (See note 2) (See note 2)
  1033: 
  1034:    Reset                 Host    TP
  1035: 
  1036:    DD 0:15               Bidir.  TS
  1037: 
  1038:    DMARQ                 Device  TS             5,6K PD                      (3)
  1039: 
  1040:    DIOR- DIOW- Host              TS
  1041: 
  1042:    IORDY                 Device  TS             1,0K                         (4)
  1043: 
  1044:    SPSYNC/CSEL                                                               (5)
  1045: 
  1046:    CSEL                  Host                   Ground   10K                 (6)
  1047: 
  1048:    SPSYNC                Device  TS/OC                   VS                  (7)
  1049: 
  1050:    DMACK-                Host    TP
  1051: 
  1052:    INTRQ                 Device  TS
  1053: 
  1054:    IOCS16-               Device  OC             1,0K
